(7053277, 1072278, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red. I am so glad that the size didn''t put people off because the image is really beautiful. I can imagine this as an illustration in - or the cover of - a children''s book.</td>', 'Congratulations on the red. I am so glad that the size didn''t put people off because the image is really beautiful. I can imagine this as an illustration in - or the cover of - a children''s book.', '2013-06-19 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 0),
