(7053301, 1072221, 109387, '<td valign="top">So glad to be on the podium for your PB party! Where are the beers? :p<br/> <br/>Congrats on the WD blue - it was clearly the winner :)</td>', 'So glad to be on the podium for your PB party! Where are the beers? :p Congrats on the WD blue - it was clearly the winner :)', '2013-06-19 04:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
